---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import {topics} from '../../data/content.json';
export function getStaticPaths(){return topics.map(topic=>({params:{id:topic.id},props:{topic}}));}
const {topic}=Astro.props;const related=topics.filter(t=>topic.related.includes(t.id));
---
<Shell title={topic.label}><a class="back-link" href="/">← All themes</a><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">{topic.category} · selected readings</span> <h1>{topic.label}</h1> <p>Read the three passages first. <a href={`https://quran-connections.moongazer.tech/?puzzle=${topic.id}`}>Try the matching Quran Connections puzzle <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p><details class="spoiler bottom-gap"><summary>Show the theme (spoiler for Quran Connections)</summary><p><strong>{topic.theme}.</strong> {topic.explanation}</p></details> <button class="button secondary" data-save={topic.id} aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button></section><div class="workspace"><section>{topic.passages.map((p,i)=><><article class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Reading {i+1} · {p.ref}</h2> <a href={p.translationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read context ↗</a></div> <div class="panel-body"><p class="arabic" lang="ar" dir="rtl">{p.arabic}</p><blockquote class="source-quote">{p.translation}</blockquote><p class="micro">Marmaduke Pickthall · Quran {p.ref}</p></div></article>{' '}</>)}</section> <aside class="sidebar"><div class="panel panel-body"><span class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</span> <h2>Connected readings</h2><div class="topic-map"><span class="map-center">This reading</span> {related.map(t=><><a href={`/topic/${t.id}/`}>{t.label} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{' '}</>)}</div><p class="micro">Editorial paths within the same study area. Connections are suggestions, not an exclusive Quranic taxonomy.</p></div> <div class="notice"><h2>Commentary</h2> <p>Read the concise Arabic commentary for the anchor passage.</p><a href={topic.commentaryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Al-Tafsir al-Muyassar ↗</a></div></aside></div><script>import '../../lib/library';</script></Shell>
<style>.spoiler summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent-ink)}.spoiler p{margin-top:8px}.topic-map{display:grid;gap:12px;padding:10px 0}.topic-map a{border-left:2px solid var(--accent);margin-left:20px;padding:8px 14px;background:var(--tint);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}.map-center{padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;text-align:center}</style>
